1 -1.023 0.324 0.098 3.318
0.001

2  0.000 0.167 0.069
2.408  0.016

3  1.023 0.010 0.095
0.100  0.920

I then plotted it using the min (1) and max (5) observed of
IV.

plotProbe(probe1, xlim = c(1,5), xlab = "SA",
ylab = "TP")

