Hello Jannik,

I am afraid you can't just 'uncheck' the check for a single observation
in a group. Because lavaan wants to compute variances and covariances
per group, and this requires multiple observations.

To make this work, you will have to manually construct the matrices, set
up a custom objective function, and feed it to the nlminb() optimizer.
Or use the OpenMx package...

Yves.

